      "name": "Dread Gaze",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>By hissing and baring your vampiric features in a Social Challenge, you strike terror into a victim who, if defeated, flees and avoids you for the rest of the scene or hour, risking an extra Trait to act against you if cornered.</p>",
