      "name": "Horrid Form",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/svg/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>By spending two Blood Traits, you warp into an eight-foot rubbery, spiked monstrosity gaining the Physical Traits Brawny, Dexterous, Enduring, Ferocious, Quick, and Stalwart along with Negative Social Traits Bestial, Feral, and Repugnant, inflicting lethal brawling damage with a bonus health level of harm until you choose to revert.</p>",
